### Large Data Analysis - REST API endpoint (another test)
POST {{PythonService_HostAddress}}/agents/large-data-analysis
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "Calculate the mean, median, and standard deviation of our sales data and find anomalies"
}

### Large Data Analysis - A2A JSON-RPC endpoint
POST {{PythonService_HostAddress}}/agents/large-data-analysis-a2a
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "run",
    "params": {
        "message": {
            "kind": "message",
            "messageId": "msg-2",
            "role": "User",
            "parts": [
                {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "text": "Perform statistical analysis on the dataset: 5, 8, 12, 15, 18, 22, 25, 28, 150"
                }
            ]
        }
    },
    "id": 1
}

### Large Data Analysis - Agent Card
GET {{PythonService_HostAddress}}/agents/large-data-analysis/.well-known/agent-card.json
Accept: application/json

### SQL test endpoint
GET {{PythonService_HostAddress}}/api/query
